  <data name="label97.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Example: To Type "abc" 
{ADOWN}{WAIT.50}{AUP}{WAIT.50}{BDOWN}{WAIT.50}{BUP}{WAIT.50}{CDOWN}{WAIT.50}{CUP}
-&gt; There's a wait between each keydown and key up.

Example: To hold down "w" and "d" at the same time for 1 second
{WDOWN}{DDOWN}{WAIT.1000}{DUP}{WUP}
-&gt; w and d are pressed exactly at the same time, held for 1 second, then released at the exact same time.

</value>
  </data>
  <data name="label96.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Adjust for preference, some example times are defaulted.  These need to be added to set how long a key is down and time between keys.  

This allows maximum customizability, but it can also simulate behavoiors that are not humanly possible.</value>
  </data>
