  <data name="lblRunAsAdministratorWarning.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>ATS can run without being administrator.  ATS captures screenshots of background windows, actively and passively clicks, and simulates keystrokes.  **Some** applications require admin to take screenshots.  If you are running from source code Visual Studio will also need to be run as Admin.  Admin can be set from the properties of the shortcut, under Capability-&gt;Settings-&gt;Run this program as an administrator.</value>
  </data>
