  <data name="Label53.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>To create an object. 
1.) Draw a box to select the image to use to search with.
2.) Name the Object.
3.) Click the Make Object Button.
4.) Make Object + Use, will update the last event with this object and switch to it.
</value>
  </data>
